home={
'id':'home','contentId':'page.home','brand':'First Crawl','title':bi('从一个真实问题，学会完整 SEO 流程','Learn the full SEO workflow, starting with one real question'),
'description':bi('为第一次做 SEO 的人准备：六步完成需求、页面、内容、发布、发现与迭代。先看懂，再动手；每步留下一份可检查的产物。','A beginner path through need, page planning, content, publication, discovery, and iteration. Understand the task, do the work, and leave a checkable output.'),
'primaryCta':bi('找到我的起点','Find my starting point'),'secondaryCta':bi('查看完整六步路线','Explore the six-stage path'),
'coreDistinction':bi('SEO 是帮助搜索引擎理解内容、帮助读者通过搜索找到页面。社交、社区和邮件引流属于推广；本路线会讲如何配合，但不把它们当成自然搜索排名。','SEO helps search engines understand content and readers find pages through search. Social, community, and email distribution are promotion; this path connects them without treating them as organic search ranking.'),
'promise':bi('你将学会选择问题、写页面简报、制作可信内容、检查发布、规划推广、读懂数据。不会承诺收录、排名、流量或收入。','Learn to choose a question, brief a page, create reliable content, check publication, plan distribution, and interpret data. No indexing, ranking, traffic, or revenue is promised.'),
'noSiteYet':bi('还没有网站？前 3 步可以在文档里完成，第 4 步用公开教学样例练习；创建账号、域名和部署是另一项任务。','No website yet? Complete stages 1–3 in documents and use public teaching examples for stage 4. Accounts, domains, and deployment are separate tasks.'),
'learningAndSkills':bi('教程告诉你为什么和怎么做；Agent Skills 帮助执行有边界的重复任务。每个 Skill 应标清输入、输出、权限、风险和测试证据。安装不等于完成 SEO，也不自动授予发布或账号访问权限。','Tutorials explain why and how. Agent Skills assist with bounded repeatable work. Each skill should declare inputs, outputs, permissions, risks, and test evidence. Installation does not complete SEO or grant publication or account access.'),
'evidenceBoundary':bi('这套六步内容经过官方资料核对，但未在你的站点端到端执行。原有抓取、sitemap、单页检查三篇教程只覆盖第 4 步；新阶段不能标成“已验证增长”。','This six-stage curriculum is checked against official sources, but has not been executed end-to-end on your site. The existing crawlability, sitemap, and page-check tutorials cover stage 4 only; new stages are not proven growth results.'),
'navigation':nav,'entries':entries,'stageIds':[s['id'] for s in stages],
'firstExercise':bi('用一个你熟悉的问题走完一轮。示例：新手如何在室内播种罗勒。它只演示方法，没有经过需求验证，也不代表已验证的搜索机会。','Take one familiar question through a loop. Example: how a beginner can start basil seeds indoors. This demonstrates the method only; demand and search opportunity are not validated.'),
'outcomes':items(('一张机会卡 → 一份页面简报 → 一个内容包','An opportunity card → a page brief → a content package'),('一份发布检查单 → 一份发现日志 → 一张改进复盘卡','A release checklist → a discovery log → an improvement review'))}
ui={'goal':bi('本步目标','Goal'),'prerequisites':bi('先弄懂这些概念','Concepts first'),'inputs':bi('开始前准备','Inputs'),'actions':bi('跟着做','Actions'),'tools':bi('可用工具','Tools'),'deliverables':bi('你要交付什么','Deliverables'),'acceptance':bi('完成标准','Acceptance criteria'),'stopConditions':bi('遇到这些情况先停下','Stop conditions'),'nextStep':bi('下一步','Next step'),'entryRequirement':bi('从这里开始的条件','Entry requirement'),'sources':bi('官方来源','Official sources')}
for s in stages:
 s['route']='/{locale}/stages/'+s['id']+'/'
 s['previousStageId']=stages[s['order']-2]['id'] if s['order']>1 else None
 s['nextStageId']=stages[s['order']]['id'] if s['order']<6 else None
 s['legacyTutorials']=[{'id':'tutorial.crawlability','slug':'crawlability','sourceFile':'check-crawlability.md'},{'id':'tutorial.sitemap','slug':'sitemap','sourceFile':'submit-sitemap.md'},{'id':'tutorial.page-check','slug':'page-check','sourceFile':'one-page-seo-check.md'}] if s['order']==4 else []
data={'schemaVersion':'1.0.0','contentVersion':'2.0.0','locales':['zh-CN','en'],'routeLocales':{'zh-CN':'zh','en':'en'},'reviewedAt':'2026-10-10','home':home,'ui':ui,'stages':stages,'sources':sources,'evidenceStates':['not-checked','hypothesis','documented','tested-locally','verified-live'],'editorialNote':bi('阶段拆分、清单、产物模板与诊断顺序是 First Crawl 的原创教学设计，不是 Google 的官方认证课程或排名公式。','Stage structure, checklists, output templates, and diagnostic sequence are original First Crawl teaching design, not a Google-certified curriculum or ranking formula.')}
(R/'workflow.json').write_text(json.dumps(data,ensure_ascii=False,indent=2)+'\n')
for locale in ['zh-CN','en']:
 short='zh' if locale=='zh-CN' else 'en'
 d=R/short;d.mkdir(exist_ok=True)
 def loc(x):
  if isinstance(x,dict):
   if locale in x:return x[locale]
   return {k:loc(v) for k,v in x.items()}
  if isinstance(x,list):return [loc(y) for y in x]
  return x
 (R/f'workflow.{short}.json').write_text(json.dumps(loc(data),ensure_ascii=False,indent=2)+'\n')
 h=['# '+home['title'][locale],home['description'][locale],'## '+('从你的进度开始' if short=='zh' else 'Start where you are')]
 for e in entries:h+=['- ['+e['label'][locale]+'](/'+short+'/stages/'+e['stageId']+'/)：'+e['reason'][locale]]
 for key in ['coreDistinction','promise','noSiteYet','learningAndSkills','evidenceBoundary','firstExercise']:h+=['',home[key][locale]]
 h+=['','## '+('六步路线' if short=='zh' else 'The six-stage path')]
 for s in stages:h+=['',f"### {s['order']}. {s['title'][locale]}",s['summary'][locale],s['deliverables'][0][locale]]
 (d/'home.md').write_text('\n\n'.join(h)+'\n')
 for s in stages:
  p=[f"---\ncontentId: {s['contentId']}\nlocale: {locale}\nreviewedAt: 2026-10-10\nstatus: editorially-reviewed-not-site-tested\n---",'# '+s['title'][locale],s['summary'][locale]]
  for key in ['entryRequirement','goal','prerequisites','inputs','actions','tools','deliverables','acceptance','stopConditions','nextStep']:
   p+=['## '+ui[key][locale]]
   if key=='actions':
    for a in s[key]:p+=['### '+a['id']+' '+a['title'][locale],a['instruction'][locale],('产物：' if short=='zh' else 'Output: ')+a['output'][locale]]
   elif isinstance(s[key],list):p+=['- '+v[locale] for v in s[key]]
   else:p+=[s[key][locale]]
  p+=['## '+ui['sources'][locale]]
  for sid in s['sourceIds']:
   src=next(x for x in sources if x['id']==sid)
   p+=['- ['+src['title']+']('+src['url']+') — '+src['supports'][locale]+' '+('核查日：' if short=='zh' else 'Checked: ')+src['checkedAt']]
  p+=['',data['editorialNote'][locale]]
  (d/(s['id']+'.md')).write_text('\n\n'.join(p)+'\n')
 (d/'sources.md').write_text('# '+ui['sources'][locale]+'\n\n'+'\n\n'.join('## '+s['title']+'\n'+s['url']+'\n\n'+s['supports'][locale]+'\n\nChecked: '+s['checkedAt'] for s in sources)+'\n')
print('Generated',len(list(R.rglob('*.md'))),'Markdown files and 3 workflow JSON files')
